      "comment": "MY AMBER (4) pinged the lids and was in the firing line early but drifted out of it when 7th at Warragul in Grade 4/5 company. Ready to return to form. SCOUT ACE (5) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 4 lengths at Warragul in a handy 22.60 beating Be My Tiger. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Expected to measure up again. RUTHLESS SECRET (2) was out of the placings last time when sixth at Warragul (23.23) but did record best time of the card when winning three back. Should be in this for a long way. DR. CALISTA (1) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
